# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Added during the MyTapeStore migration.
# Build output, database dumps and rendered video are regenerable and must not
# be in git. The WordPress build/ tree in particular contains mytapestore.sql,
# a full WooCommerce dump WITH customer records and password hashes — that is
# personal data and has no business in a code repository.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
mytapestore-wordpress/build/
**/*.sql
**/*.sql.gz
.cache/
**/.cache/
hooknloop-commercial/05_assets/generated/video/
**/*.mp4
**/*.mov
